OL,3,GNEWSCBBC Northern Ireland to get new
OL,4,Cstudio at Belfast Stories
OL,5,
OL,6,FBelfast City Council has agreed to
OL,7,Fproceed with building a studio at the
OL,8,FBelfast Stories development, for use by
OL,9,FBBC Northern Ireland.
OL,11,FThe news was confirmed in an internal
OL,12,Fcommunication to BBC NI staff
OL,13,Fyesterday.
OL,15,FA decision on the studio had previously
OL,16,Fbeen put on hold following a challenge
OL,17,Ffrom Sinn Fein, which argued the
OL,18,Fcouncil "should not have a financial
OL,19,Frelationship with a state broadcaster".
OL,20,FThe party also raised concerns about
OL,21,Ftransparency, fairness, and governance.
OL,23,EPub: 06-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,142,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14102
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F141A1793961692
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G2/3
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCBBC Northern Ireland to get new
OL,4,Cstudio at Belfast Stories
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing the Council's approval of the
OL,7,Fproject, a BBC spokesperson told The TV
OL,8,FRoom: "We are pleased to be part of the
OL,9,Fnew studio space at Belfast Stories.
OL,11,F"We think that it will facilitate
OL,12,Ffuture BBC productions and support our
OL,13,Flocal screen industries more generally.
OL,14,FPartnership working allows us to do and
OL,15,Fachieve more than would otherwise be
OL,16,Fpossible. And it delivers important
OL,17,Ffinancial benefits as well.
OL,23,EPub: 06-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,142,140,200,120,0,100
