OL,3,GNEWSCBBC Northern Ireland to get new
OL,4,Cstudio at Belfast Stories
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The Council's decision will allow us
OL,7,Fto progress and finalise the specifics
OL,8,Fof future BBC production activity on
OL,9,Fthe Belfast Stories site and associated
OL,10,Farrangements."
